WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.684 line:0%
[MUSIC]

00:00:04.685 --> 00:00:08.027 line:0%
The promise of AI has always
been to make lives better and

00:00:08.028 --> 00:00:11.940 position:56% line:0%
do things that were doing now on our
own in a much more efficient and

00:00:11.941 --> 00:00:13.750 line:0%
much more powerful way.

00:00:13.751 --> 00:00:17.710 line:0%
But to do that, AI needs to learn
and to learn, it needs information.

00:00:17.711 --> 00:00:21.210 line:0%
And one of the best sources of
information we have on the world,

00:00:21.211 --> 00:00:25.270 line:0%
and how it works is hidden in
the video cameras all around us.

00:00:25.271 --> 00:00:27.490 line:0%
A phenomenal amount of video
is generated every year.

00:00:27.491 --> 00:00:30.348 line:0%
And it's not just the hundreds of
millions of cameras all around us,

00:00:30.349 --> 00:00:34.030 line:0%
it's the billions of cell phones
that we all keep in our pockets.

00:00:34.031 --> 00:00:37.170 line:0%
Prism is a cloud software company
that connects to cameras that

00:00:37.171 --> 00:00:38.780 line:0%
are existing in the marketplace,

00:00:38.781 --> 00:00:43.100 line:0%
and analyzes that video
in a way no human can.

00:00:43.101 --> 00:00:47.950 line:0%
it slices and dices the video and
puts that into our

00:00:47.951 --> 00:00:49.959 line:0%
data structures so it's searchable
and available to customers.

00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:55.360 line:0%
Microsoft is a big part of the
smarts that help the indexing and

00:00:55.361 --> 00:00:57.350 line:0%
understanding of video happen.

00:00:57.351 --> 00:01:02.640 line:0%
To use Prism, all you have to do is
pull out your phone, and type in

00:01:02.641 --> 00:01:05.700 line:0%
what it is you're looking for
and where and Prism will find it.

00:01:07.180 --> 00:01:11.200 line:0%
The value comes from unlocking
the hidden information in video and

00:01:11.201 --> 00:01:14.990 line:0%
that can be just as valuable for
a factory or

00:01:14.991 --> 00:01:19.200 line:0%
construction site or
hospital as it is for retail store.

00:01:19.201 --> 00:01:23.620 position:56% line:0%
Prism also takes that video feed and
turns it into a stream of

00:01:23.621 --> 00:01:26.855 line:0%
information that can be used to
let that business run better.

00:01:26.856 --> 00:01:32.020 line:0%
Microsoft's computer vision
API can understand different

00:01:32.021 --> 00:01:35.820 line:0%
kinds of objects, texts,
other types of information.

00:01:35.821 --> 00:01:39.810 line:0%
Merchandisers might use us to look
into their stores around the world

00:01:39.811 --> 00:01:43.890 position:56% line:0%
or people in retail operations might
use us to build a dashboard of

00:01:43.891 --> 00:01:45.200 line:0%
important metrics.

00:01:45.201 --> 00:01:49.270 line:0%
Places like hospitals or healthcare
facilities can use Prism to

00:01:49.271 --> 00:01:51.860 line:0%
understand where their doctors are,
so

00:01:51.861 --> 00:01:54.870 line:0%
they can more quickly connect
those doctors with patients.

00:01:54.871 --> 00:01:58.640 line:0%
In verticals like industrial or
construction,

00:01:58.641 --> 00:02:02.820 position:56% line:0%
Prism can be used to help track
really important critical machinery.

00:02:02.821 --> 00:02:06.110 line:0%
If you're on a construction site,
and you wanted to be notified when

00:02:06.111 --> 00:02:09.650 line:0%
the cement mixer arrived,
you can use AI to do that.

00:02:09.651 --> 00:02:13.940 line:0%
Prism brings a really unique set of
content into the world of AI and

00:02:13.941 --> 00:02:16.500 line:0%
machine learning and
Microsoft brings some of the best

00:02:16.501 --> 00:02:19.820 line:0%
technology and people in the world
to help understand that content.

00:02:19.821 --> 00:02:21.260 line:0%
It's an exciting time and

00:02:21.261 --> 00:02:23.410 line:0%
the coolest thing about it is
we're just getting started.

